":[9409.1,3700.52,1638.46,2170.08,1900.04,0.0,0.0]},{"ts":"2025-11-13 08:00:00","channels":[10139.49,1987.42,4850.66,1760.91,1540.5,0.0,0.0]},{"ts":"2025-11-13 09:00:00","channels":[10788.52,1310.41,6412.09,1774.47,1291.55,0.0,0.0]},{"ts":"2025-11-13 10:00:00","channels":[11235.73,1200.72,7107.67,1617.55,1309.79,0.0,0.0]},{"ts":"2025-11-13 11:00:00","channels":[11261.18,1163.48,7123.97,1585.88,1387.85,0.0,0.0]},{"ts":"2025-11-13 12:00:00","channels":[11566.96,1165.74,7410.84,1574.95,1415.43,0.0,0.0]},{"ts":"2025-11-13 13:00:00","channels":[11668.38,1123.36,7457.9,1543.93,1543.19,0.0,0.0]},{"ts":"2025-11-13 14:00:00","channels":[11674.42,1131.73,7284.53,1591.32,1666.84,0.0,0.0]}]},"report":{"en":"Study for failure analysis EAF 495/2025 \u201cOn-line failure 66 kV Ovalle - Punitaqui\u201d Date of issue: 03-12-2025 1. Detailed description of disturbance a. Date and Time of failure Date 12/11/2025 Time 14:56 Off-line consumption (MW) 4.00 Prior system demand (MW) 10890 Percentage of disconnection 0.037 % Appagon Rating Not applicable (percentage of disconnection < 10%) b. Installation identification affected Installation name Line 66 kV Ovalle - Punitaqui / LT289-----------T0058 Type of installation Line Nominal voltage 66 kV Segment Zone transmission Affected facility CGE Transmission S.A RUT 77.465.741-K Legal representative Iv\u00e1n Ar\u00edstide Quezada Escobar Address Av. Presidente Riesco 5561, floor 17, Las Condes. c. Identification of the missing element Name of affected element Line 66 kV Ovalle - Punitaqui / LT289-----------T0058 Owner missing element CGE Transmission 551-A RUT 77.465. or 52B5 of S/E Ovalle. The operation was due to the operation of the function of protection of residual overflow, product of a single phase fault to ground in phase C. The company CGE Transmission S.A. indicates that the cause of the failure was the contact of a machinery with the above-mentioned line, which caused the cutting of the driver of phase C between structures N\u00b0210 and N\u00b0211. d.2 Physical Phenomenon: ACC3: Land Vehicles. The company CGE Transmission S.A. refers the background in support of the proposal of the origin of the fault, which, according to the Exenta Resolution N\u00b030989-2019 of the SEC, correspond to: \u2022 Photographic record with date, time and coordinates UTM of the failure point. \u2022 A sworn declaration of the legal representative pointing out: facts of the event, if the vehicle is a third or own and the number of times that this type of failure has occurred in the installat","es":"Estudio para an\u00e1lisis de falla EAF 495/2025\n\u201cFalla en l\u00ednea 66 kV Ovalle - Punitaqui\u201d\nFecha de Emisi\u00f3n: 03-12-2025\n1. Descripci\u00f3n pormenorizada de la perturbaci\u00f3n\na. Fecha y Hora de la falla\nFecha 12/11/2025\nHora 14:56\nConsumos desconectados (MW) 4.00\nDemanda previa del sistema (MW) 10890\nPorcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n 0.037 %\nCalificaci\u00f3n Apag\u00f3n No aplica (porcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n < 10%)\nb. Identificaci\u00f3n instalaci\u00f3n afectada\nNombre de la instalaci\u00f3n L\u00ednea 66 kV Ovalle - Punitaqui / LT289---------T0058\nTipo de instalaci\u00f3n L\u00ednea\nTensi\u00f3n nominal 66 kV\nSegmento Transmisi\u00f3n Zonal\nPropietario instalaci\u00f3n afectada CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Ar\u00edstides Quezada Escobar\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco 5561, piso 17, Las Condes.\nc. Identificaci\u00f3n del elemento fallado\nNombre del elemento afectado L\u00ednea 66 kV Ovalle - Punitaqui / LT289---------T0058\nPropietario elemento fallado CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Ar\u00edstides Quezada Escobar\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco 5561, piso 17, Las Condes.\nd.1 Origen y causa de la falla\nSe produjo la desconexi\u00f3n forzada de la l\u00ednea 66 kV Ovalle - Punitaqui tras la apertura autom\u00e1tica del\ninterruptor 52B5 de S/E Ovalle. La operaci\u00f3n se debi\u00f3 a la actuaci\u00f3n de la funci\u00f3n de protecci\u00f3n de\nsobrecorriente residual, producto de una falla monof\u00e1sica a tierra en la fase C.\nLa empresa CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A. indica que la causa de la falla fue el contacto de una maquinaria con\nla mencionada l\u00ednea, lo que provoc\u00f3 el corte del conductor de la fase C entre las estructuras N\u00b0210 y\nN\u00b0211.\nd.2 Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico:\nACC3: Veh\u00edculos terrestres.\nLa empresa CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A. remite los antecedentes en respaldo a la proposici\u00f3n del origen de\nla falla, los que, de acuerdo con lo indicado en la Resoluci\u00f3n Exenta","shown_language":"en","word_scores":[{"w":"study","s":0.09},{"w":"failure","s":0.2},{"w":"eaf","s":-0.19},{"w":"2025","s":0.17},{"w":"failure","s":0.2},{"w":"66","s":-0.27},{"w":"kv","s":-0.02},{"w":"date","s":-0.08},{"w":"description","s":0.04},{"w":"date","s":-0.08},{"w":"time","s":-0.16},{"w":"failure","s":0.2},{"w":"date","s":-0.08},{"w":"12","s":0.09},{"w":"11","s":-0.15},{"w":"2025","s":0.17},{"w":"time","s":-0.16},{"w":"14","s":-0.45},{"w":"consumption","s":-0.09},{"w":"mw","s":0.15},{"w":"00","s":0.22},{"w":"prior","s":0.04},{"w":"mw","s":0.15},{"w":"percentage","s":0.04},{"w":"disconnection","s":0.02},{"w":"percentage","s":0.04},{"w":"disconnection","s":0.02},{"w":"10","s":-0.01},{"w":"installation","s":0.15}]},"predictions":{"conflux":{"pred":"line_fault","display_pred":"LINE FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.9868,"breaker_fault":0.0051,"transformer_fault":0.0016,"busbar_fault":0.0065},"confidence":0.9868,"correct":true},"quorum":{"pred":"line_fault","display_pred":"LINE FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.5003,"breaker_fault":0.1356,"transformer_fault":0.0764,"busbar_fault":0.2877},"confidence":0.5003,"correct":true},"nexus":{"pred":"line_fault","display_pred":"LINE FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.5949,"breaker_fault":0.1309,"transformer_fault":0.1101,"busbar_fault":0.1641},"confidence":0.5949,"correct":true}},"explanations":{"con